{"1929990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pirate Souls", "steam_appid": 1929990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro-style Pirate MMORPG with large focus on community and PvP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-to-play forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/8910c8144f8fe04e39cf156ffc5bc516.poster.avif?t=1782528349\" width=770 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/8910c8144f8fe04e39cf156ffc5bc516.webm?t=1782528349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/8910c8144f8fe04e39cf156ffc5bc516.mp4?t=1782528349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Sailor in a harsh sea of thieves and heroes!</strong>Start off as a sailor and choose to join the Navy or become a Pirate! Become scum of the sea, or become a hero in the eyes of the law. Things aren't black and white in the world of Pirate Souls.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/197a3ae5a0bd53ec376aac8403323194.poster.avif?t=1782528349\" width=770 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/197a3ae5a0bd53ec376aac8403323194.webm?t=1782528349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/197a3ae5a0bd53ec376aac8403323194.mp4?t=1782528349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World PvP &amp; Hardcore Game Design</strong>This may be a turn off for some, but Pirate Souls is a very hardcore game. So take this as a word of warning... Absolute freedom when it comes to PvP also means a bad time for some with a low tolerance for being killed for no reason. But for others, it's just another reason to get stronger!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/8a1aea55397c20373deb45336c4ed461.poster.avif?t=1782528349\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/8a1aea55397c20373deb45336c4ed461.webm?t=1782528349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/8a1aea55397c20373deb45336c4ed461.mp4?t=1782528349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Character Customization in the right places</strong>Choose your faction, join a crew and obtain a soul fruit power. Combined with thousands of equip-able items, no two seafarers will ever look or be the same. Pirate Souls is a game where you are encouraged to express yourself. Looking good doesn't cost you to lose fights.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro-style Pirate MMORPG with large focus on community and PvP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-to-play forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/8910c8144f8fe04e39cf156ffc5bc516.poster.avif?t=1782528349\" width=770 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/8910c8144f8fe04e39cf156ffc5bc516.webm?t=1782528349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/8910c8144f8fe04e39cf156ffc5bc516.mp4?t=1782528349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Sailor in a harsh sea of thieves and heroes!</strong>Start off as a sailor and choose to join the Navy or become a Pirate! Become scum of the sea, or become a hero in the eyes of the law. Things aren't black and white in the world of Pirate Souls.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/197a3ae5a0bd53ec376aac8403323194.poster.avif?t=1782528349\" width=770 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/197a3ae5a0bd53ec376aac8403323194.webm?t=1782528349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/197a3ae5a0bd53ec376aac8403323194.mp4?t=1782528349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World PvP &amp; Hardcore Game Design</strong>This may be a turn off for some, but Pirate Souls is a very hardcore game. So take this as a word of warning... Absolute freedom when it comes to PvP also means a bad time for some with a low tolerance for being killed for no reason. But for others, it's just another reason to get stronger!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/8a1aea55397c20373deb45336c4ed461.poster.avif?t=1782528349\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/8a1aea55397c20373deb45336c4ed461.webm?t=1782528349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/extras/8a1aea55397c20373deb45336c4ed461.mp4?t=1782528349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Character Customization in the right places</strong>Choose your faction, join a crew and obtain a soul fruit power. Combined with thousands of equip-able items, no two seafarers will ever look or be the same. Pirate Souls is a game where you are encouraged to express yourself. Looking good doesn't cost you to lose fights.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A 2D Online RPG where you can become the most wanted pirate, the strongest bounty hunter or even the highest-ranking Marine! Customize your character to be uniquely yours, level up and find treasures. Start your adventure in the world of Pirate Souls now!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/header.jpg?t=1782528349", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782528349", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929990/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782528349", "website": "https://piratesouls.org/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz dual core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Hardware Accelerated Graphics with dedicated memory, 1GB memory recommended<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz dual core<br></li><li><stro